flowchart TD
    A[Player Input: Guess] --> B[Streamlit UI - app.py]
    B --> C[Game Logic - logic_utils.py]
    C --> D[Guess History / Session State]
    D --> E[Coach Agent - coach.py]
    E --> E1[Analyze: narrow range from history]
    E1 --> E2[Propose: compute midpoint + generate hint]
    E2 --> E3[Evaluate: confidence score]
    E3 -->|confidence high enough| F[Act: display tip in UI]
    E3 -->|confidence too low / high stakes| G[Defer: tell player to proceed alone]
    F --> H[Coach log - session_state.coach_log]
    G --> H
    H --> I[Test Harness - tests/test_harness.py]
    I --> J[Reliability Summary printed to console]
